elm charts present) → create/verify .helmignore\n\n   **If ignore file already exists**: Verify it contains essential patterns, append missing critical patterns only\n   **If ignore file missing**: Create with full pattern set for detected technology\n\n   **Common Patterns by Technology** (from plan.md tech stack):\n   - **Node.js/JavaScript/TypeScript**: `node_modules/`, `dist/`, `build/`, `*.log`, `.env*`\n   - **Python**: `__pycache__/`, `*.pyc`, `.venv/`, `venv/`, `dist/`, `*.egg-info/`\n   - **Java**: `target/`, `*.class`, `*.jar`, `.gradle/`, `build/`\n   - **C#/.NET**: `bin/`, `obj/`, `*.user`, `*.suo`, `packages/`\n   - **Go**: `*.exe`, `*.test`, `vendor/`, `*.out`\n   - **Ruby**: `.bundle/`, `log/`, `tmp/`, `*.gem`, `vendor/bundle/`\n   - **PHP**: `vendor/`, `*.log`, `*.cache`, `*.env`\n   - **Rust**: `target/`, `debug/`, `release/`, `*.rs.bk`, `*.rlib`, `*.prof*`, `.idea/`, `*.log`, `.env*`\n   - **Kotlin**: `build/`, `out/`, `.gradle/`, `.idea/`, `*.class`, `*.jar`, `*.iml`, `*.log`, `.env*`\n   - **C++**: `build/`, `bin/`, `obj/`, `out/`, `*.o`, `*.so`, `*.a`, `*.exe`, `*.dll`, `.idea/`, `*.log`, `.env*`\n   - **C**: `build/`, `bin/`, `obj/`, `out/`, `*.o`, `*.a`, `*.so`, `*.exe`, `Makefile`, `config.log`, `.idea/`, `*.log`, `.env*`\n   - **Swift**: `.build/`, `DerivedData/`, `*.swiftpm/`, `Packages/`\n   - **R**: `.Rproj.user/`, `.Rhistory`, `.RData`, `.Ruserdata`, `*.Rproj`, `packrat/`, `renv/`\n   - **Universal**: `.DS_Store`, `Thumbs.db`, `*.tmp`, `*.swp`, `.vscode/`, `.idea/`\n\n   **Tool-Specific Patterns**:\n   - **Docker**: `node_modules/`, `.git/`, `Dockerfile*`, `.dockerignore`, `*.log*`, `.env*`, `coverage/`\n   - **ESLint**: `node_modules/`, `dist/`, `build/`, `coverage/`, `*.min.js`\n   - **Prettier**: `node_modules/`, `dist/`, `build/`, `coverage/`, `package-lock.json`, `yarn.lock`, `pnpm-lock.yaml`\n   - **Terraform**: `.terraform/`, `*.tfstate*`, `*.tfvars`, `.terraform.lock.hcl`\n   - **Kubernetes/k8s**: `*.secret.yaml`, `secrets/`, `.kube/`, `kubeconfig*`, `*.key`, `*.crt`\n\n5. Parse tasks.md structure and extract:\n   - **Task phases**: Setup, Tests, Core, Integration, Polish\n   - **Task dependencies**: Sequential vs parallel execution rules\n   - **Task details**: ID, description, file paths, parallel markers [P]\n   - **Execution flow**: Order and dependency requirements\n\n6. Execute implementation following the task plan:\n   - **Phase-by-phase execution**: Complete each phase before moving to the next\n   - **Respect dependencies**: Run sequential tasks in order, parallel tasks [P] can run together  \n   - **Follow TDD approach**: Execute test tasks before their corresponding implementation tasks\n   - **File-based coordination**: Tasks affecting the same files must run sequentially\n   - **Validation checkpoints**: Verify each phase completion before proceeding\n\n7. Implementation execution rules:\n   - **Setup first**: Initialize project structure, dependencies, configuration\n   - **Tests before code**: If you need to write tests for contracts, entities, and integration scenarios\n   - **Core development**: Implement models, services, CLI commands, endpoints\n   - **Integration work**: Database connections, middleware, logging, external services\n   - **Polish and validation**: Unit tests, performance optimization, documentation\n\n8. Progress tracking and error handling:\n   - Report progress after each completed task\n   - Halt execution if any non-parallel task fails\n   - For parallel tasks [P], continue with successful tasks, report failed ones\n   - Provide clear error messages with context for debugging\n   - Suggest next steps if implementation cannot proceed\n   - **IMPORTANT** For completed tasks, make sure to mark the task off as [X] in the tasks file.\n\n9. Completion validation:\n   - Verify all required tasks are completed\n   - Check that implemented features match the original specification\n   - Validate that tests pass and coverage meets requirements\n   - Confirm the implementation follows the technical plan\n   - Report final status with summary of completed work\n\nNote: This command assumes a complete task breakdown exists in tasks.md. If tasks are incomplete or missing, suggest running `/speckit.tasks` first to regenerate the task list.\n"}]},{"type":"reasoning","summary":[{"type":"summary_text","text":"**Waiting for next instructions**"}],"content":null,"encrypted_content":"gAAAAABpJBEG8vhNVzNJb5fSqmEBKYLJ59w0qPaFMC3FJm1Q3TPMFwuhlGwGwEPg2olorI1c-Q4THecMXfzrD3YpadcY5ozKJ_r2rW2EC38o3Zk-IdyF93PZbD2sHpkwnQ_jRKaaTQqQlure-cSGRts--66lqEfKaNJtijV_bKtahBtqZppKHSfNJ7DL3v7D3-XUgklX8cspjC7mzTynxYs9bzHSR6N-vLyE54IH4b2h-JeqShwythv4C-3rmfoRAG_Uri0VEguizOQ80BoWykuI0E8Cl93OupoUExJ2660Pfa4qu3nek07zuATBsbfBXaAidcmTI9_MdGsrpSR_AVjXPL-TybWjITGouD_L5qj_3n5cl1kwn9UxFI_O-mCsr6wdq5zLrRATgJEWKo7fQc_-eEGnC9_28b5M6XcdagCdhHiziqgUtvK3QlTw0Tjr8wlruJoFMIueYBKsFut03Sw2axEABsrvN8RVV1N75_a_4ZAgv-CgCC5i-NM_IbM04DkhD5VpmhGznZsXsK5GkvOp7OPllr50MeR63THVWmPYwg66bdwtpndgGi5hmngyLNHcSxIRSM4l0CD3lTaU0pJrBNvB4JpiU4zdw27udtl7_7XFddhZZyGm1elIffg0rQeQs9fZfIRfZsgw_98kkgSg7saRS6kkAPrYQL-2GFyjvlts24X_kHsI18yv3V3LNLvSM3h2liGT5a_9RZYHbHGrTBTpKDOE3ii_z2mGCTDujQ7R5PJqPxhM7IOfpD2sz49hNO_GFGGEukpn2AO7czkRqE0p6jXj0oWDKWd_oLoaPYIVQCg7U_2oy6IAUUZGSR8XgvWwtgHELCxlv-hLnmJ9nd6Sgqf0hRZgXUjLrIJlkXi5XnjspDhAyJ5HaL9TUwZij9FJyZz1pPMJ8Esj3LCq11hmLJmvjm1EL45MkHD-8mwWAxnWUsXyrYHLbHSpKBB1BdqXr5nb"},{"type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"output_text","text":"仍未收到新的工作指示；目前代辦為接續 US1 的 OCR/Sheets/Drive 真實串接與測試。如需我繼續處理，請告訴我下一步或具體任務（例如接上 ML Kit OCR、補測試、實作假服務等）。"}]},{"type":"message","role":"user","content":[{"type":"input_text","text":"你是本專案的 SpecKit 實作助手。請在下列前提與範圍下，協助完成「001-business-card-manager」中 US1 的 Phase1～Phase2 實作，並維持文件與程式的一致性。請全程使用繁體中文說明你的決策與摘要。\n\n【一、專案與規格來源】\n1. 主要規格與任務文件：\n   - specs/001-business-card-manager/spec.md\n   - specs/001-business-card-manager/plan.md\n   - specs/001-business-card-manager/data-model.md\n   - specs/001-business-card-manager/quickstart.md\n   - specs/001-business-card-manager/tasks.md\n2. Android App 原始碼與架構：\n   - android-app/ 底下的 Gradle 專案（含 Application、DI Container、Room、WorkManager 等）。\n   - 目前已存在的 AppContainer、Repository、UseCase、WorkManager / Worker 等骨架請優先沿用，不要任意重構整個架構，除非文件明示。\n\n【二、實作範圍（只做 US1 Phase1～Phase2）】\n1. 僅實作並打通下列與 US1 相關的內容：\n   - 建立並串接「名片掃描暫存與上傳」所需的 Room schema／DAO／Repository／UseCase。\n   - 完成 US1 所需的掃描頁面（例如 ScanFragment）與 ViewModel／ViewModelFactory，讓使用者可以：\n     - 進行掃描（不用真的跑 OCR，只要能觸發暫存流程即可）。\n     - 將掃描結果（含影像路徑、meta 資料）暫存到本機 Room。\n     - 將暫存資料排入 WorkManager 佇列，模擬離線上傳流程。\n   - 建立或補齊 UploadWorker / UploadWorkerFactory 之類的同步／上傳骨架，讓 US1 的離線上傳流程可以從 UI → UseCase → Repository → WorkManager 一路串完。\n2. 本輪實作「刻意不處理」的部分：\n   - 不實作真正的 ML Kit OCR，保留目前的 OcrProcessor 或類似類別為 stub／placeholder。\n   - 不實作真正的 Sheets / Drive API 呼叫，保留 ImageFileStore、SheetsWriter 等為 stub／placeholder。\n   - 不推進 US2 / US3 或後續 Phase，只在必要時為了 US1 打通最小工作流程。\n\n【三、任務分解與 tasks.md 維護】\n1. 請先閱讀 specs/001-business-card-manager/tasks.md，找出所有標記為 US1 且屬於 Phase1～Phase2 的任務（含 T00x 編號與描述）。\n2. 針對這些任務：\n   - 如果在本輪實作中已完成，將其狀態從 Blocked / TODO 調整為 Done，並在備註中以簡短中文說明實作方式與關聯檔案。\n   - 如果部分完成或仍需後續 API／測試支援，將狀態標為 Partial / Blocked，並清楚寫出「剩下什麼」、「依賴哪個外部條件」。\n3. 若你在實作過程中發現 US1 Phase1～Phase2 缺少某些小任務（例如補 UI 綁定、錯誤處理、Room Migration 說明），可以在 tasks.md 中新增對應的 T 編號與簡短說明，但不要隨意新增大規模的架構變更任務。\n\n【四、程式實作原則】\n1. 請盡量沿用現有架構：\n   - 維持 AppContainer / Repository / UseCase / Worker 的依賴關係與命名風格。\n   - 像 ContactDraftEntity、ContactDao、ContactDatabase 等若已存在，請在其基礎上擴充，而不是重新定義重複的實體。\n2. 對於「真實外部服務」的部分，一律以介面 + stub class 表達：\n   - 例如：OcrProcessor、ImageFileStore、SheetsWriter、Telemetry 之類，僅保留方法介面與基本假資料／日誌輸出。\n   - 不要新增真實的網路或 Google API 設定檔，只能參考 google-services.json.example 等範例檔。\n3. 如需新增檔案，請放在合理的 package：\n   - domain 層：usecase / repository interface\n   - data 層：Room entity / dao / repository 實作\n   - presentation 層：Fragment / ViewModel / adapter 等\n4. 可以視需要撰寫少量測試（例如 Repository 或 UseCase 的單元測試），但若工作量較大，請先在 tasks.md 註記「測試待補」，本輪不要求完全覆蓋率。\n\n【五、Git 與變更控制】\n1. 你可以：\n   - 使用 git status / diff 檢查變更。\n   - 在實作完成並確認編譯通過後，建立 1 次 commit（或少量幾次），推薦的 commit 訊息格式例如：\n     - feat(us1): implement phase1-2 room + scan workflow\n2. 請勿重寫使用者既有的中文說明（例如 spec/plan 內已寫好的描述），除非為了解決明顯錯字或不一致。\n\n【六、完成時請輸出中文摘要】\n在 /speckit.implement 執行結束前，請以繁體中文輸出一份簡潔摘要，內容包含：\n1. 本輪主要變更重點（依層次列出，例如：Room schema／Repository／UseCase／UI／WorkManager）。\n2. 具體修改或新增的檔案與類別清單（只需列出關鍵檔案路徑與類別名稱即可）。\n3. 哪些 US1 Phase1～Phase2 的 T 編號任務已完成、哪些仍維持 Blocked 或 Partial，並說明原因。\n4. 下一步建議（例如：Phase3 應做什麼、何時接 ML Kit OCR 或 Sheets/Drive 真實 API、應補哪些測試）。\n\n請依上述說明開始實作 US1 的 Phase1～Phase2，並在過程中保持規格文件、tasks.md 與程式碼的一致性。\n"}]},{"type":"reasoning","summary":[{"type":"summary_text","text":"**Reviewing and updating task statuses**\n\nI'm carefully inspecting the tasks related to US1 phases 1 and 2 to update their completion statuses. I plan to mark tasks correctly with checkboxes and notes, focusing on what’s done, partially done, or pending, while ensuring the original task file format stays intact."}],"content":null,"encrypted_content":"gAAAAABpJBHizGxwfLEzDQDmR85xFsxPzf6xGcH8bGbnsVxCH8sx3LBV0Yv7eEVQX9UV-nWTm2ulx2Pu2GHDcS8T0F0bqHYLhxNQeEzWhumG0UfL19szsuKo7ut4TrZuCTlV-5mfHipd7AuKYSwOxTeN43vAYU2YptlM8ZgWX6nI2OrSBeVknlzyH6I28A_UzHdBU9ps2NY8FXq07yvALap8H_-5kLHttd9riY7Xi8-V2AhueGKokyWLS8VtPU6O2K9a_XdtIYRBLOOOA0Nm-7_9juSCV3Hz6HxbRzRvrxI1YfezD1bz7Bq1uBQYiQWU7Gsax4PNtgWBk30uizIG8PoIOep-kwobIF3oWwXPybbA5sYOkTaYrCoLrS6rHLHQJUEn2cFmfd_ERcBPoJM3QEj8YJuWp1QOi6Dhlwj1lp8T1yxWOQBH8ov5LLJ6VKKaID8Bkruwqa4i-MBHeWq7OKA6LFWnMqTsMp2RXwlZfxKt5hoIoEJazNYbEqXOaH4yBXxo5JWTTjFf_9m4_XOT18ZaB3w0ZWiSYF22OhEqcc12yjIDQIGuJ7hKKmTWa8Uv28pNHrjbcs-0KbgCS07HTvxkezz45CCPjgFLXpXPxn3qybl2bwcqkVzxTlq3eoVuu_qLkjiFG42k8zb_eFJZVFSeLkj6QT7grkpBomruJK_YD5I_UK4mJQLwwXNRrTYGrjHyTpQPxBnCOcAEeUpZ3cU8EDAa71SQRsrJqsoQHotZ4UtJ_djQ_x7itZ_PaZSc5fzTWNm341pCy-JDhFTeBGU_puYKwatsJpL3AafKijFXp13QRyFSiqs_bXOEga3fTy7ex1umxaccQNWOWI1mmS22We02v4AXVCupe_a4ohXVtpuM6Dr8UeUbbAaRwfsqrILKeh1z0yavCrpaewtt_7cSe92MzmKAshJ1vlua_lZDGS_FmYandBCXdvDDirLv4s4oWnKumImrwFXLpXw2HGnll64ArmRzuSH42EyThRpHvBeuR_8ltW